WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:00,678
Oh no!

2
00:00:00,798 --> 00:00:03,253
A muddy blob is splashing the lemonade stand!

3
00:00:03,373 --> 00:00:05,984
Welcome back to Cloud Town, high up in the sky!

4
00:00:06,104 --> 00:00:07,673
This is Episode 46.

5
00:00:07,793 --> 00:00:08,829
Mud on the lemons.

6
00:00:08,949 --> 00:00:09,884
Mud on the cups.

7
00:00:09,963 --> 00:00:11,096
Here comes the sieve gate.

8
00:00:11,216 --> 00:00:11,954
A little wall.

9
00:00:12,074 --> 00:00:12,697
A little gate.

10
00:00:16,150 --> 00:00:16,998
Friends float up.

11
00:00:17,118 --> 00:00:18,025
The gate opens.

12
00:00:18,145 --> 00:00:18,617
Come in!

13
00:00:24,150 --> 00:00:25,253
The blob charges.

14
00:00:25,373 --> 00:00:26,218
The gate shuts.

15
00:00:26,338 --> 00:00:26,812
Bounce!

16
00:00:26,932 --> 00:00:27,371
Splat!

17
00:00:33,150 --> 00:00:34,379
The blob puts on a hat.

18
00:00:34,499 --> 00:00:35,009
Sneaky.

19
00:00:35,129 --> 00:00:36,242
The gate is not fooled.

20
00:00:36,362 --> 00:00:37,014
Still shut.

21
00:00:41,150 --> 00:00:41,891
Friends get in.

22
00:00:42,011 --> 00:00:42,847
Mud stays out.

23
00:00:42,967 --> 00:00:44,066
Every single time.

24
00:00:48,150 --> 00:00:49,188
That is the sieve gate.

25
00:00:49,308 --> 00:00:51,377
It checks who is knocking before they get in.

26
00:00:51,497 --> 00:00:52,877
Now you know WAF!

27
00:00:54,150 --> 00:00:56,068
Check out the Cloud Town book series.

28
00:00:56,208 --> 00:00:57,126
Link in the bio.

29
00:00:57,266 --> 00:00:58,235
See you next time!

